.SH DESCRIPTION
A QLayoutItem that represents widget.
.PP
For custom layouts.
.PP
See also: QLayout.
.SH MEMBER FUNCTION DOCUMENTATION
.SH "QWidgetItem::QWidgetItem ( QWidget * w )"
Creates an item containing \fIw.\fR
.SH "QSizePolicy::ExpandData QWidgetItem::expanding() const \fC[virtual]\fR"
Returns whether this item's widget is expanding.
.PP
Reimplemented from QLayoutItem.
.SH "QRect QWidgetItem::geometry () const \fC[virtual]\fR"
Reimplemented for internal reasons; the API is not affected.
.PP
Reimplemented from QLayoutItem.
